{"parse": {"title": "命运的雨季-01", "pageid": 123673, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B4%9D%E4%B8%BD%E5%B0%94%C2%B7%E5%91%BD%E8%BF%90%E7%9A%84%E9%9B%A8%E5%AD%A3\" title=\"贝丽尔·命运的雨季\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">命运的雨季-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%91%BD%E8%BF%90%E7%9A%84%E9%9B%A8%E5%AD%A3-02\" title=\"命运的雨季-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">命运的雨季</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.87.8E.E7.9B.B2.E5.8C.BA\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视野盲区\">视野盲区</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 视野盲区</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Unforeseen</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-shezhengjie.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"shezhengjie\"><img alt=\"shezhengjie\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-shezhengjie.png/600px-Cg-shezhengjie.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-shezhengjie.png/900px-Cg-shezhengjie.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-shezhengjie.png/1200px-Cg-shezhengjie.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304143.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-304143.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304143.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304143.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-304143.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304143.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-304143.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304143.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>让一让！别挤我！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>哇啊！粗鲁的家伙，你踩到我的脚了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>喧哗之中，没人注意到女孩的愤怒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她无力抵抗人群的推搡，只得随波逐流。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>糟了，大人们全部涌去前面了，我等会儿什么都看不见！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>玛蒂尔达，想想现在该怎么做？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>噢，我知道了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩小心倒退着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>还算结实！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩找到废弃的木箱，谨慎地踩了上去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>这可是那个“基金会”罕见的校外巡礼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>好歹是布翁尼家长期的合作对象，我也能趁机深入了解一下他们～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>如果能打听到他们的秘密就再好不过了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>那些可以躲过怪“雨”的安全屋，他们是怎么找到的呢……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩思考了片刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>妈妈为他们提供了那么多灵验的预言，要求这种程度的坦诚肯定不过分呀！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>不过，基金会帮助布翁尼家的这份慷慨，玛蒂尔达很欣赏！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>我以后也会接手布翁尼家的生意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>有担当的未来话事人当然要来给他们捧场……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>洁白的仪仗队缓缓走来，年幼的神秘学家们迈着一致的步伐，姿态大方地展现所属机构的风貌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>为首的橙色身影，打断了女孩的自语，将她的骄傲稀释成犹疑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>她是谁……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>仪仗队的成员必然是优秀的，然而这个女孩无疑是最优秀的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>任何人都能看得出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"502001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-502001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-502001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"502001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-502001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-502001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-502001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-502001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小孩：</div><div>妈妈！我以后也要像这个姐姐一样，站在所有人前面！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-503401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-503401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-503401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>那你就得努力成为最优秀的人啦，这样你才能为大家引领前进的方向呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>最优秀……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛蒂尔达环顾四周。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>所有人都在看着她……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>橙发女孩从她面前经过，继而远离。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>思绪鼓胀在胸膛里，她的心跳开始加快。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>接着，她毫无征兆地跳下木箱，头也不回地跑走了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_13.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_13\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_13\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-3_2_bg_13.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-3_2_bg_13.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_13.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-3_2_bg_13.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_13.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>妈妈，我有事——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但看清屋内的情景后，女孩止住了话语，小心地退到一旁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一位瘦削的妇女握紧双手，焦虑而渴盼地望着面前之人，以及她手里的水晶灵摆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">焦虑的母亲：</div><div>贝丽尔女士，我女儿的病能治好吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>名为贝丽尔的占卜师并未答话，她神色淡然，半垂着眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>每天都有好多人来向妈妈求助呀……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩状似无奈地感叹着，面上是藏不住的骄傲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的母亲因必定应验的预言闻名遐迩，于是占卜师的话语成为一束光，启迪困境中的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>这就是布翁尼家的占卜师，我也会成为能力比肩妈妈的优秀之人！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩自豪地注视着母亲，见证灵摆光芒熄灭、占卜师给予点拨的时刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>您的女儿会无恙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">焦虑的母亲：</div><div>那我该怎么做？我已经跑遍了巴黎的医院……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>医疗手段并非治愈疾症的唯一选择，流言蜚语带来的威胁不亚于任何病菌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">焦虑的母亲：</div><div>您是说……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">焦虑的母亲：</div><div>我明白了，贝丽尔女士，真的很感谢您！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>妇女站起身来，向占卜师行了一礼，接着抱起她购入的满满一箱水晶匆匆离开了工房。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>甚至没有顾上从箱子里掉落的水晶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>这位客人，您的水晶掉了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛蒂尔达高声提醒着，试图小跑着追上，却被母亲拦了下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>她的目的不在于购买水晶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>与笃定的未来相比，水晶没有实际价值。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>那妈妈你接下来还会有客人吗？我想……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>我知道，玛蒂尔达，先去门外将打烊的牌子挂上吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝丽尔捡起地上散落的水晶，柔和地看着自己的女儿。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_13.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_13\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_13\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-3_2_bg_13.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-3_2_bg_13.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_13.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-3_2_bg_13.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_13.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛蒂尔达眉飞色舞地描述着巡礼，以及那位橙发的女孩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝丽尔维持着微笑，她的视线轻轻地落在女儿身上，又看似飘远。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>……玛蒂尔达承认她看起来确实不赖！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>但只要我转学过去，下次巡礼的领队一定会是玛蒂尔达！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>到时候她就得看着我的背影……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>兴奋之中，她没有留意母亲手中的灵摆再次微弱地亮了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>妈妈……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>玛蒂尔达，你提前占卜过我的回答吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>……不，我没有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>为什么呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>这件事不需要占卜！就算妈妈你不答应，玛蒂尔达也有把握说服你！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>你现在似乎就在做这件事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>如果你提前知道了答案，就不必如此辛苦了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛蒂尔达敏锐地察觉到母亲的潜台词，得偿所愿的欣喜即刻充盈了情绪的触角。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女儿没有及时意识到从母亲身上倏然显露的某种情绪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>妈妈，你的意思是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>这没有什么不可以的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>太好了！到时候我——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>噢，真是抱歉，打扰你们的谈话了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不速之客推门而入，屋外的喧闹与混乱灌入屋内。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她说着抱歉，却不显局促。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>这位没有礼貌的客人，门口已经挂上打烊的标志了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>我们不会再接待……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>玛蒂尔达。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女儿诧异地看向母亲，却见母亲脸上时常维系的笑容不知何时浅淡了些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>贝丽尔·布翁尼，没有人的预言比您的更灵验。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>在您的眼里，过去、当下与未来并置存在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>今天到来的客人，只是昨日显现的回忆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>您早早地挂上了歇业的指示牌，符合未来施予您的指引。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>——但我来了，在您的意料之外。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "命运的雨季-01"}}